533				<p>This is a well-structured, accessible HTML5 document demonstrating modern best practices for semantic markup and inclusive design.</p>
534				<p>
535					It uses semantic landmarks, a skip link for keyboard navigation,
536					and CSS that adapts to your light or dark mode preference.
537				</p>
538				<p>
539					Text and link colors meet WCAG AA contrast in both themes, type scales
540					with your browser's font size, and motion respects your system settings.
541				</p>
