546				<ul>
547					<li>Semantic HTML structure with proper landmarks</li>
548					<li>Keyboard accessible navigation and focus management</li>
549					<li>Dark mode support with custom color schemes</li>
550					<li>Responsive typography using modern CSS</li>
551					<li>Print-friendly styles for better readability</li>
552					<li>WCAG AA contrast compliance in all color modes</li>
553				</ul>
554			</section>
