559					<h3>Component Cards</h3>
560					<p>Card components are useful for organizing related content. They include a subtle border and padding for visual separation.</p>
561					<a class="button" href="#resources">Learn more<span class="visually-hidden"> about accessibility resources</span></a>
562				</article>
